OL,3,GNEWSA'Unmissable' sea slug could be new
OL,4,Aspecies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brightly-coloured sea slug spotted
OL,7,Foff an island's coast could potentially
OL,8,Fbe a new species, according to marine
OL,9,Fexperts.
OL,11,FThe Marine Biological Association said
OL,12,Fthe orange, purple and white
OL,13,Fnudibranch, also known as a sea slug,
OL,14,Fwas spotted by Maggs Ashton while she
OL,15,Fwas diving with Ilfracombe and North
OL,16,FDevon Sub-Aqua Club off Lundy.
OL,18,FThe creature, which was spotted in the
OL,19,Fwreckage of the MV Robert and measured
OL,20,F15mm (0.6 inches) in length, was found
OL,21,Fabout 20 metres (65.6ft) under water.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
